      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has been an issue since before the recent update. But previously this bug did not occur nearly as often and was much easier to fix, simply reloading your model by changing to a new model and swapping back worked, as well as reloading the model by muting and unmuting all users in the menu. \nI can also back up that this issue is a lot more common with the recent patch, and cannot be fixed like it was before. One semi-solution is to find a position to put your hands when you load your model in, that when you sync to your model the bug does no occur, I experimented a bit and found that for me, if I keep my hands to my chest and point the fingers up and palms together the bug does not occur when I sync into my model.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
